[{"id":"fm-core1-1.32-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>Given <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, show that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\arsinh x=\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2+1})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Swap <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x=\\sinh y\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{e^y-e^{-y}}2\\Rightarrow2x=e^y-e^{-y}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow2xe^y=e^{2y}-1\\Rightarrow0=e^{2y}-2xe^y-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=(e^y-x)^2-x^2-1\\Rightarrow(e^y-x)^2=x^2+1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow e^y-x=\\pm\\sqrt{x^2+1}\\Rightarrow e^y=x\\pm\\sqrt{x^2+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Now <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"e^y&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x-\\sqrt{x^2+1}&lt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"e^y=x+\\sqrt{x^2+1}\\Rightarrow y=\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2+1})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\arsinh x=\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2+1})\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.32-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>Given <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, show that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\arcosh x=\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2-1})\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>stating the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for which <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arcosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> exists.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is many-to-one, so we take <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to restrict the domain to make it one-to-one.</p>","<p>Swap <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x=\\cosh y\\text{ where }y&gt;0\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{e^y+e^{-y}}2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow2x=e^y+e^{-y}\\Rightarrow2xe^y=e^{2y}+1\\Rightarrow0=e^{2y}-2xe^y+1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=(e^y-x)^2-x^2+1\\Rightarrow(e^y-x)^2=x^2-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow e^y-x=\\pm\\sqrt{x^2-1}\\Rightarrow e^y=x\\pm\\sqrt{x^2-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow y=\\ln(x\\pm\\sqrt{x^2-1})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Now, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(x+\\sqrt{x^2-1})(x-\\sqrt{x^2-1})\\equiv x^2-(x^2-1)\\equiv1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x-\\sqrt{x^2-1}\\equiv\\frac1{x+\\sqrt{x^2-1}}\\equiv(x+\\sqrt{x^2-1})^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\ln(x-\\sqrt{x^2-1})\\equiv\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2-1})^{-1}\\equiv-\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2-1})\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow y=\\pm\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2-1})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, we must have that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2-1})\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\arcosh x=\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2-1})\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.32-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>Given <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, show that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\artanh x=\\frac12\\ln(\\frac{1+x}{1-x})\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>stating the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for which <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\artanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> exists.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Swap <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x=\\tanh y\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{e^{2y}-1}{e^{2y}+1}\\Rightarrow x(e^{2y}+1)=e^{2y}-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow xe^{2y}+x=e^{2y}-1\\Rightarrow x+1=e^{2y}-xe^{2y}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow1+x=(1-x)e^{2y}\\Rightarrow e^{2y}=\\frac{1+x}{1-x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow2y=\\ln(\\frac{1+x}{1-x})\\Rightarrow y=\\frac12\\ln(\\frac{1+x}{1-x})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\artanh x=\\frac12\\ln(\\frac{1+x}{1-x})\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-1&lt;x&lt;1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.32-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>Write down the exact values of the following:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arsinh1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh^{-1}2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\artanh\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh^{-1}(-4)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arcosh9\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\tanh^{-1}(-\\frac12)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arsinh1=\\ln(1+\\sqrt{1^2+1})=\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh^{-1}2=\\ln(2+\\sqrt{2^2-1})=\\ln(2+\\sqrt3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\artanh\\frac13=\\frac12\\ln(\\frac{1+\\frac13}{1-\\frac13})=\\frac12\\ln2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh^{-1}(-4)=\\ln(-4+\\sqrt{(-4)^2+1})=\\ln(-4+\\sqrt{17})\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arcosh9=\\ln(9+\\sqrt{9^2-1})=\\ln(9+\\sqrt{80})=\\ln(9+4\\sqrt5)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\tanh^{-1}(-\\frac12)=\\frac12\\ln(\\frac{1+(-\\frac12)}{1-(-\\frac12)})=\\frac12\\ln\\frac13=-\\frac12\\ln3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.32-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>Solve the following equations, writing your answers in exact form:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x=-6\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\arsinh0=\\ln(0+\\sqrt{0^2+1})=\\ln1=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\arsinh3=\\ln(3+\\sqrt{3^2+1})=\\ln(3+\\sqrt{10})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x=-6\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\arsinh(-6)=\\ln(-6+\\sqrt{(-6)^2+1})=\\ln(-6+\\sqrt{37})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.32-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>Solve the following equations, writing your answers in exact form:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x=6\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x=\\frac32\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\pm\\arcosh1=\\pm\\ln(1+\\sqrt{1^2-1})=\\pm\\ln1=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x=6\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\pm\\arcosh6=\\pm\\ln(6+\\sqrt{6^2-1})=\\pm\\ln(6+\\sqrt{35})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x=\\frac32\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\pm\\arcosh\\frac32=\\pm\\ln(\\frac32+\\sqrt{(\\frac32)^2-1})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\pm\\ln(\\frac32+\\sqrt{\\frac54})=\\pm\\ln(\\frac{3+\\sqrt5}{2})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.32-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Solve the following equations, writing your answers in exact form:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\tanh x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\tanh x=\\frac14\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\tanh x=-\\frac56\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\tanh x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\artanh0=\\frac12\\ln(\\frac{1+0}{1-0})=\\frac12\\ln1=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\tanh x=\\frac14\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\artanh\\frac14=\\frac12\\ln(\\frac{1+\\frac14}{1-\\frac14})=\\frac12\\ln\\frac53\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\tanh x=-\\frac56\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\artanh(-\\frac56)=\\frac12\\ln(\\frac{1+(-\\frac56)}{1-(-\\frac56)})=\\frac12\\ln\\frac1{11}=-\\frac12\\ln11\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.32-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>Solve the following equations, writing your answers in exact form:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh2x=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh3x=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5\\tanh(3x-1)=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3\\sinh(2-\\frac13x)=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh2x=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow2x=\\arsinh5\\Rightarrow2x=\\ln(5+\\sqrt{5^2+1})\\Rightarrow x=\\frac12\\ln(5+\\sqrt{26})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh3x=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow3x=\\pm\\arcosh8=\\pm\\ln(8+\\sqrt{8^2-1})\\Rightarrow x=\\pm\\frac13\\ln(8+\\sqrt{63})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\pm\\frac13\\ln(8+3\\sqrt7)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5\\tanh(3x-1)=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\tanh(3x-1)=\\frac25\\Rightarrow3x-1=\\artanh\\frac25\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow3x-1=\\frac12\\ln(\\frac{1+\\frac25}{1-\\frac25})=\\frac12\\ln\\frac73\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\frac13(\\frac12\\ln\\frac73+1)=\\frac16\\ln\\frac73+\\frac13\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3\\sinh(2-\\frac13x)=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\sinh(2-\\frac13x)=\\frac13\\Rightarrow2-\\frac13x=\\arsinh\\frac13\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow2-\\frac13x=\\ln(\\frac13+\\sqrt{(\\frac13)^2+1})=\\ln(\\frac13+\\sqrt{\\frac{10}9})=\\ln(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{10}}3)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=3(2-\\ln(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{10}}3))=6-3\\ln(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{10}}3)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.32-q9","number":9,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Sketch and label the graphs of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> on the same axes.</p></li><li><p>Prove that the graphs of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> do not intersect.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.32/solutions/assets/diagrams/132-s9a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> intersect if there are solutions to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\frac{\\sinh x}{\\cosh x}=1\\Rightarrow\\tanh x=1\\Rightarrow x=\\artanh1=\\frac12\\ln(\\frac{1+1}{1-1})\\text{ which is undefined}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> do not intersect.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.32-q10","number":10,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Sketch and label the graphs of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh^2x\\equiv1+\\sinh^2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, prove that the graphs of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> do not intersect.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.32/solutions/assets/diagrams/132-s10a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> intersect if there are solutions to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x=\\tanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\cosh x=\\frac{\\sinh x}{\\cosh x}\\Rightarrow\\cosh^2x=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow1+\\sinh^2x=\\sinh x\\Rightarrow\\sinh^2x-\\sinh x+1=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(\\sinh x-\\frac12)^2-(\\frac12)^2+1=0\\Rightarrow(\\sinh x-\\frac12)^2=-\\frac34\\text{ which has no real solutions.}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> do not intersect.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.32-q11","number":11,"question":"<p>Solve the following equations, writing your answers in exact form:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh^2x+\\sinh x-12=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\cosh^2x-\\cosh x-21=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"12\\tanh^2x+\\tanh x-1=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh^2x+\\sinh x-12=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(\\sinh x+4)(\\sinh x-3)=0\\Rightarrow\\sinh x=-4\\text{ or }\\sinh x=3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x=-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\arsinh(-4)=\\ln(-4+\\sqrt{(-4)^2+1})=\\ln(-4+\\sqrt{17})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\arsinh3=\\ln(3+\\sqrt{3^2+1})=\\ln(3+\\sqrt{10})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore x=\\ln(-4+\\sqrt{17})\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\ln(3+\\sqrt{10})\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\cosh^2x-\\cosh x-21=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(2\\cosh x-7)(\\cosh x+3)=0\\Rightarrow\\cosh x=\\frac72\\text{ or }\\cosh x=-3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x=-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has no real solutions.</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x=\\frac72\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\pm\\arcosh\\frac72=\\pm\\ln(\\frac72+\\sqrt{(\\frac72)^2-1})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\pm\\ln(\\frac72+\\sqrt{\\frac{45}4})=\\pm\\ln(\\frac{7+3\\sqrt5}2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore x=\\pm\\ln(\\frac{7+3\\sqrt5}2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"12\\tanh^2x+\\tanh x-1=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(4\\tanh x-1)(3\\tanh x+1)=0\\Rightarrow\\tanh x=\\frac14\\text{ or }\\tanh x=-\\frac13\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\tanh x=\\frac14\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\artanh\\frac14=\\frac12\\ln(\\frac{1+\\frac14}{1-\\frac14})=\\frac12\\ln\\frac53\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\tanh x=-\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\artanh(-\\frac13)=\\frac12\\ln(\\frac{1+(-\\frac13)}{1-(-\\frac13)})=\\frac12\\ln\\frac12=-\\frac12\\ln2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore x=\\frac12\\ln\\frac53\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\frac12\\ln2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.32-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>Solve the equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3\\cosh^2x+10\\cosh x-25=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> writing your answers in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\ln k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a rational number.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3\\cosh^2x+10\\cosh x-25=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(3\\cosh x-5)(\\cosh x+5)=0\\Rightarrow\\cosh x=\\frac53\\text{ or }\\cosh x=-5\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x=-5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has no real solutions.</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x=\\frac53\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\pm\\arcosh\\frac53=\\pm\\ln(\\frac53+\\sqrt{(\\frac53)^2-1})=\\pm\\ln(\\frac53+\\frac43)=\\pm\\ln3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\ln3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\ln3=\\ln\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.32-q13","number":13,"question":"<p>Solve the equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3\\cosh^2x-17\\cosh x-56=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> writing your answers in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\ln(a+b\\sqrt7)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are integers.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3\\cosh^2x-17\\cosh x-56=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(3\\cosh x+7)(\\cosh x-8)=0\\Rightarrow\\cosh x=8\\text{ or }\\cosh x=-\\frac73\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x=-\\frac73\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has no real solutions.</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\pm\\arcosh8=\\pm\\ln(8+\\sqrt{8^2-1})=\\pm\\ln(8+3\\sqrt7)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\ln(8+3\\sqrt7)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\ln(8+3\\sqrt7)=\\ln(\\frac1{8+3\\sqrt7})=\\ln(8-3\\sqrt7)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore x=\\ln(8+3\\sqrt7)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\ln(8-3\\sqrt7)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.32-q14","number":14,"question":"<p>Solve the following equations:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arsinh x=\\ln2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arcosh x=\\ln3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\artanh x=\\ln4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arsinh2x=2\\ln3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arcosh3x=3\\ln2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\artanh\\frac12x=2\\ln\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arsinh x=\\ln2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2+1})=\\ln2\\Rightarrow x+\\sqrt{x^2+1}=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\sqrt{x^2+1}=2-x\\Rightarrow x^2+1=(2-x)^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x^2+1=x^2-4x+4\\Rightarrow1=-4x+4\\Rightarrow4x=3\\Rightarrow x=\\frac34\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Alternative Method:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\arsinh x=\\ln2\\Rightarrow x=\\sinh(\\ln2)=\\frac{e^{\\ln2}-e^{-\\ln2}}2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{e^{\\ln2}-e^{\\ln(1/2)}}2=\\frac{2-\\frac12}{2}=\\frac34\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arcosh x=\\ln3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2-1})=\\ln3\\Rightarrow x+\\sqrt{x^2-1}=3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\sqrt{x^2-1}=3-x\\Rightarrow x^2-1=(3-x)^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x^2-1=x^2-6x+9\\Rightarrow-1=-6x+9\\Rightarrow6x=10\\Rightarrow x=\\frac53\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Alternative Method:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\arcosh x=\\ln3\\Rightarrow x=\\cosh(\\ln3)=\\frac{e^{\\ln3}+e^{-\\ln3}}2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{e^{\\ln3}+e^{\\ln(1/3)}}2=\\frac{3+\\frac13}{2}=\\frac53\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\artanh x=\\ln4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\frac12\\ln(\\frac{1+x}{1-x})=\\ln4\\Rightarrow\\ln(\\frac{1+x}{1-x})=2\\ln4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(\\frac{1+x}{1-x})=\\ln16\\Rightarrow\\frac{1+x}{1-x}=16\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow1+x=16-16x\\Rightarrow17x=15\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{15}{17}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Alternative Method:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\artanh x=\\ln4\\Rightarrow x=\\tanh(\\ln4)=\\frac{e^{2\\ln4}-1}{e^{2\\ln4}+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{e^{\\ln16}-1}{e^{\\ln16}+1}=\\frac{16-1}{16+1}=\\frac{15}{17}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arsinh2x=2\\ln3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\arsinh2x=\\ln9\\Rightarrow\\ln(2x+\\sqrt{(2x)^2+1})=\\ln9\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow2x+\\sqrt{4x^2+1}=9\\Rightarrow\\sqrt{4x^2+1}=9-2x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow4x^2+1=(9-2x)^2\\Rightarrow4x^2+1=4x^2-36x+81\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow1=-36x+81\\Rightarrow36x=80\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{20}{9}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Alternative Method:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\arsinh2x=2\\ln3\\Rightarrow\\arsinh2x=\\ln9\\Rightarrow2x=\\sinh(\\ln9)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\frac12\\times\\frac{e^{\\ln9}-e^{-\\ln9}}2=\\frac{e^{\\ln9}-e^{\\ln(1/9)}}4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{9-\\frac19}{4}=\\frac{20}{9}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arcosh3x=3\\ln2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\arcosh3x=\\ln8\\Rightarrow\\ln(3x+\\sqrt{(3x)^2-1})=\\ln8\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow3x+\\sqrt{9x^2-1}=8\\Rightarrow\\sqrt{9x^2-1}=8-3x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow9x^2-1=(8-3x)^2\\Rightarrow9x^2-1=64-48x+9x^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow-1=64-48x\\Rightarrow48x=65\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{65}{48}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Alternative Method:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\arcosh3x=3\\ln2\\Rightarrow\\arcosh3x=\\ln8\\Rightarrow3x=\\cosh(\\ln8)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\frac13\\times\\frac{e^{\\ln8}+e^{-\\ln8}}2=\\frac{e^{\\ln8}+e^{\\ln(1/8)}}6\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{8+\\frac18}{6}=\\frac{65}{48}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\artanh\\frac12x=2\\ln\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\artanh\\frac12x=\\ln\\frac14\\Rightarrow\\frac12\\ln(\\frac{1+\\frac12x}{1-\\frac12x})=\\ln\\frac14\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(\\frac{1+\\frac12x}{1-\\frac12x})=2\\ln\\frac14=\\ln\\frac1{16}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\frac{1+\\frac12x}{1-\\frac12x}=\\frac1{16}\\Rightarrow16(1+\\frac12x)=1-\\frac12x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow16+8x=1-\\frac12x\\Rightarrow\\frac{17}2x=-15\\Rightarrow x=-\\frac{30}{17}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Alternative Method:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\artanh\\frac12x=2\\ln\\frac12\\Rightarrow\\artanh\\frac12x=\\ln\\frac14\\Rightarrow\\frac12x=\\tanh(\\ln\\frac14)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=2\\times\\frac{e^{2\\ln\\frac14}-1}{e^{2\\ln\\frac14}+1}=2\\times\\frac{e^{\\ln\\frac1{16}}-1}{e^{\\ln\\frac1{16}}+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=2\\times\\frac{\\frac1{16}-1}{\\frac1{16}+1}=2\\times(-\\frac{15}{17})=-\\frac{30}{17}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.32-q15","number":15,"question":"<p>Solve the following equations:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\sinh(\\ln(3-x))\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh(\\ln(2x-1))=x+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x-1=\\tanh(\\ln\\sqrt{x+1})\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\sinh(\\ln(3-x))\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\arsinh x=\\ln(3-x)\\Rightarrow\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2+1})=\\ln(3-x)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x+\\sqrt{x^2+1}=3-x\\Rightarrow\\sqrt{x^2+1}=3-2x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x^2+1=(3-2x)^2\\Rightarrow x^2+1=9-12x+4x^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=3x^2-12x+8\\Rightarrow0=3(x^2-4x)+8\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=3((x-2)^2-4)+8\\Rightarrow0=3(x-2)^2-12+8\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow3(x-2)^2=4\\Rightarrow(x-2)^2=\\frac43\\Rightarrow x-2=\\pm\\frac{2\\sqrt3}3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=2\\pm\\frac{2\\sqrt3}3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2-\\frac{2\\sqrt3}3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> only as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\ln(3-x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is undefined when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2+\\frac{2\\sqrt3}3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Alternative Method:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x=\\sinh(\\ln(3-x))\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{e^{\\ln(3-x)}-e^{-\\ln(3-x)}}2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow2x=e^{\\ln(3-x)}-e^{\\ln((3-x)^{-1})}\\Rightarrow2x=3-x-\\frac1{3-x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\frac1{3-x}=3-3x\\Rightarrow1=(3-x)(3-3x)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow1=9-12x+3x^2\\Rightarrow0=3x^2-12x+8\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=3(x^2-4x)+8\\Rightarrow0=3((x-2)^2-4)+8\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=3(x-2)^2-12+8\\Rightarrow3(x-2)^2=4\\Rightarrow(x-2)^2=\\frac43\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x-2=\\pm\\frac{2\\sqrt3}3\\Rightarrow x=2\\pm\\frac{2\\sqrt3}3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2-\\frac{2\\sqrt3}3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> only as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\ln(3-x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is undefined when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2+\\frac{2\\sqrt3}3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh(\\ln(2x-1))=x+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(2x-1)=\\arcosh(x+2)=\\ln(x+2+\\sqrt{(x+2)^2-1})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow2x-1=x+2+\\sqrt{x^2+4x+3}\\Rightarrow x-3=\\sqrt{x^2+4x+3}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(x-3)^2=x^2+4x+3\\Rightarrow x^2-6x+9=x^2+4x+3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow-6x+9=4x+3\\Rightarrow6=10x\\Rightarrow x=\\frac35\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Alternative Method:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\cosh(\\ln(2x-1))=x+2\\Rightarrow\\frac{e^{\\ln(2x-1)}+e^{-\\ln(2x-1)}}2=x+2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow e^{\\ln(2x-1)}+e^{\\ln((2x-1)^{-1})}=2x+4\\Rightarrow2x-1+\\frac1{2x-1}=2x+4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\frac1{2x-1}=5\\Rightarrow2x-1=\\frac15\\Rightarrow x=\\frac35\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x-1=\\tanh(\\ln\\sqrt{x+1})\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\artanh(x-1)=\\ln\\sqrt{x+1}\\Rightarrow\\frac12\\ln(\\frac{1+(x-1)}{1-(x-1)})=\\frac12\\ln(x+1)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(\\frac{x}{2-x})=\\ln(x+1)\\Rightarrow\\frac{x}{2-x}=x+1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=(x+1)(2-x)\\Rightarrow x=-x^2+x+2\\Rightarrow x^2=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\sqrt2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> only as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{x+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is not real when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\sqrt2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Alternative Method:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x-1=\\tanh(\\ln\\sqrt{x+1})\\Rightarrow x-1=\\frac{e^{2\\ln\\sqrt{x+1}}-1}{e^{2\\ln\\sqrt{x+1}}+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x-1=\\frac{e^{\\ln(x+1)}-1}{e^{\\ln(x+1)}+1}\\Rightarrow x-1=\\frac{x+1-1}{x+1+1}=\\frac{x}{x+2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(x-1)(x+2)=x\\Rightarrow x^2+x-2=x\\Rightarrow x^2=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\sqrt2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> only as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{x+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is not real when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\sqrt2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.32-q16","number":16,"question":"<p>Solve the following equations:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\artanh x-\\ln(1+x)=\\ln\\frac65\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\ln2+\\ln(1+x)-\\artanh x=\\ln\\frac29\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arsinh x-\\ln(1+x)=\\ln2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\ln3+\\ln(x-1)-\\arcosh x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\artanh x-\\ln(1+x)=\\ln\\frac65\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac12\\ln(\\frac{1+x}{1-x})-\\ln(1+x)=\\ln\\frac65\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(\\frac{1+x}{1-x})-2\\ln(1+x)=2\\ln\\frac65\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(\\frac{1+x}{1-x})-\\ln(1+x)^2=\\ln\\frac{36}{25}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(\\frac{1+x}{1-x}\\times\\frac1{(1+x)^2})=\\ln\\frac{36}{25}\\Rightarrow\\frac1{(1-x)(1+x)}=\\frac{36}{25}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(1-x)(1+x)=\\frac{25}{36}\\Rightarrow1-x^2=\\frac{25}{36}\\Rightarrow x^2=\\frac{11}{36}\\Rightarrow x=\\pm\\frac{\\sqrt{11}}6\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\ln2+\\ln(1+x)-\\artanh x=\\ln\\frac29\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(2(1+x))-\\frac12\\ln(\\frac{1+x}{1-x})=\\ln\\frac29\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow2\\ln(2(1+x))-\\ln(\\frac{1+x}{1-x})=2\\ln\\frac29\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(4(1+x)^2)-\\ln(\\frac{1+x}{1-x})=\\ln\\frac4{81}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(4(1+x)^2\\times\\frac{1-x}{1+x})=\\ln\\frac4{81}\\Rightarrow4(1+x)(1-x)=\\frac4{81}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow1-x^2=\\frac1{81}\\Rightarrow x^2=\\frac{80}{81}\\Rightarrow x=\\pm\\frac{4\\sqrt5}{9}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arsinh x-\\ln(1+x)=\\ln2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2+1})-\\ln(1+x)=\\ln2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2+1})=\\ln2+\\ln(1+x)=\\ln(2+2x)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x+\\sqrt{x^2+1}=2+2x\\Rightarrow\\sqrt{x^2+1}=2+x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x^2+1=(2+x)^2\\Rightarrow x^2+1=4+4x+x^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow1=4+4x\\Rightarrow4x=-3\\Rightarrow x=-\\frac34\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\ln3+\\ln(x-1)-\\arcosh x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(3x-3)-\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2-1})=0\\Rightarrow\\ln(3x-3)=\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2-1})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow3x-3=x+\\sqrt{x^2-1}\\Rightarrow2x-3=\\sqrt{x^2-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(2x-3)^2=x^2-1\\Rightarrow4x^2-12x+9=x^2-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow3x^2-12x+10=0\\Rightarrow3(x^2-4x)+10=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow3((x-2)^2-4)+10=0\\Rightarrow3(x-2)^2-12+10=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(x-2)^2=\\frac23\\Rightarrow x-2=\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac23}\\Rightarrow x=2\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac23}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2+\\sqrt{\\frac23}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> only as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2-\\sqrt{\\frac23}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> does not solve the original equation.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.32-q17","number":17,"question":"<p>Solve the following equations:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arsinh x+\\ln2=\\arcosh x+\\ln3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arsinh x-2\\arcosh x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arsinh x+\\ln2=\\arcosh x+\\ln3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2+1})+\\ln2=\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2-1})+\\ln3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(2x+2\\sqrt{x^2+1})=\\ln(3x+3\\sqrt{x^2-1})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow2x+2\\sqrt{x^2+1}=3x+3\\sqrt{x^2-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow2\\sqrt{x^2+1}-3\\sqrt{x^2-1}=x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(2\\sqrt{x^2+1}-3\\sqrt{x^2-1})^2=x^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow4(x^2+1)-12\\sqrt{x^4-1}+9(x^2-1)=x^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow4x^2+4+9x^2-9-x^2=12\\sqrt{x^4-1}\\Rightarrow12x^2-5=12\\sqrt{x^4-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(12x^2-5)^2=144(x^4-1)\\Rightarrow144x^4-120x^2+25=144x^4-144\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow-120x^2+25=-144\\Rightarrow120x^2=169\\Rightarrow x^2=\\frac{169}{120}\\Rightarrow x=\\pm\\frac{13\\sqrt{30}}{60}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac{13\\sqrt{30}}{60}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> only as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arcosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arsinh x-2\\arcosh x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2+1})-2\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2-1})=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2+1})=\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2-1})^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x+\\sqrt{x^2+1}=(x+\\sqrt{x^2-1})^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x+\\sqrt{x^2+1}=x^2+2x\\sqrt{x^2-1}+x^2-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\sqrt{x^2+1}-2x\\sqrt{x^2-1}=2x^2-x-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(\\sqrt{x^2+1}-2x\\sqrt{x^2-1})^2=(2x^2-x-1)^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x^2+1-4x\\sqrt{x^4-1}+4x^2(x^2-1)=4x^4-4x^3-3x^2+2x+1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow4x^3-2x=4x\\sqrt{x^4-1}\\Rightarrow2x^2-1=2\\sqrt{x^4-1}\\text{ as }x\\ne0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(2x^2-1)^2=4(x^4-1)\\Rightarrow4x^4-4x^2+1=4x^4-4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow-4x^2+1=-4\\Rightarrow4x^2=5\\Rightarrow x^2=\\frac54\\Rightarrow x=\\pm\\frac{\\sqrt5}2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac{\\sqrt5}2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> only as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arcosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]}]